<title>GERMANY: Brau und Brunnen sells Einbecker stake.</title>
<headline>Brau und Brunnen sells Einbecker stake.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German beverage group Brau und Brunnen AG said on Thursday it was selling its 79.3 percent in the Einbecker brewery to a group of investors in Cologne.</p>
<p>Brau und Brunnen said the investor group already held a 10 percent stake in Einbecker. Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The sale must still be approved by the supervisory board of Brau und Brunnen, which is majority-owned by Bayerische Hypotheken-und Wechsel Bank.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
